      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes they should have switched over to raycasting as soon as the community started utilising it more in worlds, and there have been plenty of requests over the years. All they really had to do was add a range to the UI Shape component raycast  and both world creators and the camera could utilise much more responsive UI.\nWhile they are at it fixing interaction issues they might want to finally fix their triggers breaking interaction at some point. This particular bug does actually make it impossible to use the camera and other interactive volumes.\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/putting-an-oninteract-trigger-inside-a-vrctrigger-volume-makes-it-impossible-to",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
